.TH SDL_HINT_MOUSE_DEFAULT_SYSTEM_CURSOR 3 "SDL 3.5.0" "Simple Directmedia Layer" "SDL3 FUNCTIONS"
.SH NAME
SDL_HINT_MOUSE_DEFAULT_SYSTEM_CURSOR \- A variable setting which system cursor to use as the default cursor.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <SDL3/SDL_hints.h>
.PP
.BI "#define SDL_HINT_MOUSE_DEFAULT_SYSTEM_CURSOR \(dqSDL_MOUSE_DEFAULT_SYSTEM_CURSOR\(dq
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
This should be an integer corresponding to the
.BR SDL_SystemCursor
enum\[char46] The default value is zero
.BR "" ( SDL_SYSTEM_CURSOR_DEFAULT )\[char46]
.PP
This hint needs to be set before
.BR SDL_Init ()\[char46]

.SH AVAILABILITY
This hint is available since SDL 3\[char46]2\[char46]0\[char46]

